#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24c865ac6a53abb4c81fa4f5712e142cdb406acf7f903249ed28597211bd583f
